Dependencies
------------
The application shell (apps/shell) is built with Tauri 2 and its dialog,
fs, opener and single-instance plugins (MIT OR Apache-2.0, the Tauri
Programme within The Commons Conservancy and Tauri contributors), and the
crates they depend on, each under its own licence as listed in
apps/shell/Cargo.lock; the shipped app includes them. The engine crates
use only the Rust standard library. See docs/PROVENANCE.md.

